zul'kesh ith xyrrhak

drun 2026 · ka'thakh: kibi kelburton


ghaz'oth.
ssen'thal ka'thal dhov ssev, vrae'thakh, drun'kal, vrae'dhaa zha dhaa'thrak xyrrhak.
kesh'nul. dhe'hak nul.

vrae'oth.
zhi zul'kesh khaev khal khem vrrk vrae'thakh ith xyrrhak.
ka dhov nul drun'kal zhi zul'kesh.

thik'oth.
zhi zul'kesh thrak nul hrr'ghaz.
hrr'ghaz ith ka'thakh ith ssurr.

khos'oth.
xyrrhak dhaas ossk'ghaz.
vhor'kesh nul. thrak'zul nul dhaas.
ka'thakh ghaesh'ghaz nul ghae krrin khu drun vrrsh'kal vhe xyrrhak.

zhur'oth.
vhi ka skraak zhi zul'kesh, thaas zhi zul'kesh krr'vos ghae ssu.


zhaal'vaal.
